Z||000007||Big O||03-11-2000||07:20 PM||||Classes?? There's gotta be Classes??  This is going to be a Show and Shine gathering of anyone whose got a Fiero and wants to share stories.  Yes, There will be some goodies to give away, but this is going to be a VERY low keyed affair for lots of fun and not competition.  We will also be sharing the lot with the Modesto Throttlers and their street rods, some street bracket racers (I hope) want to play, and I've got a line on a Monster truck that may show up.  Lighten up guys -- classes????  By the way Stimpy,  do you think I'm crazy enought to give you my ride to take up in the hills???? Kids!!!<P>||||reg||10
Z||000008||DXR_DAD||03-12-2000||02:24 AM||||Ok, good that's what I wanted to hear, just show and shine with a lotta FUN.....in the sun???. What does it look like out there, any sun? Hight 70's?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>I got your E-mail, Big O how many Golden Gate Fieros will be there?||||reg||1
Z||000009||Big O||03-12-2000||10:30 AM||||The weather yesterday was beautiful.  In the 60's with lots of SS.  I'm not sure how many Fiero's will be coming but I've got replies from folks as far as Auburn to the north and Merced to the south.  I hope we can attract some locals as well as there will be an announcement in the Sunday paper as well.  Stimpy and future Mrs. Stimpy got in last night and we're having a nice visit.  I've got to get him going on shining up the ride.  I promised to let him have the Rocket for the week if he would bring it back in one piece and nice and shiny.  He's smiling now.<BR>||||reg||1
